{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d3383ba53afc95629af67ace270268e8a80b8e0b7a23b5429d3069b3ad86b8d5", "ja": "（『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、昴と学校にやってきた。\n今回は掃除中の姿を撮るという事で、準備中だ）", "zh": "（这次《偶像写真！！》的拍摄来到了昴的学校。听说要拍她打扫时的样子，现在正在做准备。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "dda9615edc024b2f8e99cee21e07b6f7254168b15aeda6863f86abb02125579c", "ja": "廊下を掃除すればいいんだろ？\nそれなら楽勝だぜ♪", "zh": "只要打扫走廊就行了吧？\n那可太轻松了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3267e900482d4d61e4c08008c81cfddc739d3cc557b89d2f57cc875f9a73351a", "ja": "はは、頼もしいな。小道具も、\n普段使ってるようなものばかりだぞ。ほら。", "zh": "哈哈，真可靠啊。小道具也都是平时常用的东西。看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "b1a9ba8dcb094e9c6e7aa1efb8538c158c7d705091b361ad632afa71d0e59d12", "ja": "ほうきとちりとりと、雑巾かー。\nホントに、いつもの学校の掃除みたいだな。", "zh": "扫帚、簸箕，还有抹布啊——\n真的就像平时在学校打扫一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "7d3577a06fd8646e7edeb9e8509d267db88d6f1208011c9c00c8029d61f97e2c", "ja": "こういうの見てると、野球がしたくなるよな～。\n雑巾をボールにしてさ……。", "zh": "看到这些，就让人想打棒球了啊～  \n把抹布当球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f18fed0dedfcd8be8af30ea6569247aa7d754005c48ebd63faea7472b99e602d", "ja": "ほうきをバットにしたり？", "zh": "拿扫帚当球棒之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "9b221855d838691921e560ce1ac649576c9d7756c5d2f845f212e78c49c6881c", "ja": "そう！　掃除の時間に、みんなでやってるんだ。\nオレ、雑巾のボールでスライダー投げられるんだぜ！", "zh": "没错！打扫的时候，我们会一起拿来玩。\n我可是能用抹布球投出滑球的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "db7b9c22cdc5f0e8f71aa8eea73d18fc33dbe7a434eaca6e7b4bba0f89553747", "ja": "すごいだろ？　投げられるようになるまで、\nけっこう練習したんだー。へへっ♪", "zh": "很厉害吧？为了练到能投出来，我可是练了好一阵子呢——嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "ef4b627eebf90f0449dc044ad704e40fd902de308494156c83ba23ae809389e9", "ja": "そうだ！　撮影始まるまで、野球して待ってようぜ！\nオレの自慢の雑巾スライダー、見せてやるよ！", "zh": "对了！在拍摄开始前，我们打棒球消磨时间吧！\n让你见识一下我引以为傲的抹布滑球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c7e2ddce6533bc5c2ac8bc79364c804cecb5efd02c908f516a827d8543b5964a", "ja": "すごく見てみたいけど、また今度にしよう。\nそろそろ、撮影が始まりそうだし……。", "zh": "虽然我很想见识一下，但还是下次吧。\n差不多要开始拍摄了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "3bdd1beb49f278ea6c4af31ba3c9d035e98c9b10d0867fd0d48e618a89a60ec3", "ja": "あ、もうそんな時間だったんだ。\nそれじゃ、撮影が終わったらやろうぜ！", "zh": "啊，已经到这个时间了啊。\n那就等拍摄结束后再做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1011_camman", "source_sha256": "2048cc93dc60ac9e32b52f97c642f93c7a830749b968452885bae1bb26117ef9", "ja": "すみません、永吉さん。撮影なんですけど、掃除道具で\n野球をしているところを撮らせてもらえませんか？", "zh": "抱歉，永吉小姐。虽然是拍摄工作，但能让我们拍摄您用清洁工具打棒球的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "b1af8a459611b75745efddd9b65138d1c434d2cea58be8dc812b832e96af2354", "ja": "えっ！？　……野球していいの！？", "zh": "诶！？……可以打棒球吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1013_camman", "source_sha256": "37bc971213a51b8c9b6d104722448e55ff6980174b4cd26251713ccee31cc592", "ja": "はい。\n掃除をサボるシチュエーションも、面白そうだなと！", "zh": "是的。偷懒不打扫的情境，感觉也会很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "eb4747cb1cb523cc84f7f1f8293666993007ff86e674ece50fe4d96d29fd75fb", "ja": "へー。いつもは、掃除道具で遊ぶなって怒られるのに、\nなんかヘンな感じだな！", "zh": "诶——平时明明会因为拿清洁工具玩而被骂，今天却感觉有点奇怪啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7e758e42bf50565868f151f9894c039b0bfb892eb20ba0c947cf5d6c41f746a4", "ja": "確かにな。でも、昴らしくていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "说得也是。不过，这不正是昴的风格嘛，挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "cb6a29afff28f16773021c038878a8a35310fa9e4552112ec8053a9360f09e19", "ja": "そっか！　それじゃ、全力でいくぜー！\n{$P$}、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "这样啊！那我就全力以赴啦——！\n{$P$}，我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "6319bb02a7bf4d3ad07f2ade09f3820cc97aef271450149d49a371914ee403a6", "ja": "次はこれだー！　魔球……雑巾、スライダー！！", "zh": "接下来是这个！魔球……抹布滑球！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "36321a880120e67110db3b75d886867a9ed611aff155aa84dac37e174ef084c1", "ja": "うわあっ、委員長！？　ご、ごめんって！\nもうサボらないからー！", "zh": "呜哇，班长！？对、对不起嘛！  \n我以后再也不偷懒了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0173_1020_p", "source_sha256": "238beddc71195e65ff782afe27d8934d0ad9fb78eadb0d3f1cb5a00df537c60c", "ja": "（掃除をサボった昴が、その後叱られるまで……\n昴の色々な表情が見られる、いい写真になったな！）", "zh": "（这张记录了偷懒没打扫的昴，以及后来被训斥前后的各种表情……真是张不错的照片啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
